"strong\">Daniel</span>: Taste it. It's not sugar!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: It's salt! We have to get in touch with the supplier! They'll have to check their supplies. Daniel, bring the bag.  You'd better come with me. We have to explain this.", "id": 2, "time": "27500", "image": "engenn8le02ob06re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I've come to apologize again. Daniel.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Daniel</span>: This is what I used in the cheesecake, Sir. You can see it's clearly marked. It's supposed to be sugar not salt. We're never supposed to taste the dessert batters. So, I did not know there was a problem. It looked fine.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Client</span>: Thank you for coming out to explain. I understand that they do not want you tasting while you're cooking. However, after this I guess you ought to at least taste the sugar.", "id": 3, "time": "49000", "image": "engenn8le02ob06re2img02.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn8le02ob06re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn8le02ob06re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}